rootfs/ is packed into build/images/initrd.tar by tools/mkimage.py and loaded
with "qemu -initrd" (or a GRUB "module" line). The ramdisk driver exposes it
as block device rd0; the tar file system (milestone M4) mounts it as /initrd.
etc/undertow.conf holds the settings of Undertow (bin/undertow, the web browser): the clock's offset, fixed host addresses.
www/ is the sample site that "httpd on" serves when it is given no folder (bin/httpd, the web server).
